{"ref":"BDB, מִרְיָם","hw":"מִרְיָם","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מִרְיָם</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.f.</strong> et <strong>m. </strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  <strong> f.</strong> sister of Aaron <a data-ref=\"Exodus 15:20\" href=\"/Exodus.15.20\">Ex 15:20</a> (E), and of Moses and Aaron <a data-ref=\"Numbers 26:59\" href=\"/Numbers.26.59\">Nu 26:59</a> (P), <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 5:29\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.5.29\">1 Ch 5:29</a>; named also <a data-ref=\"Exodus 15:21\" href=\"/Exodus.15.21\">Ex 15:21</a> (E), <a data-ref=\"Numbers 12:1\" href=\"/Numbers.12.1\">Nu 12:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 12:4\" href=\"/Numbers.12.4\">4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 12:5\" href=\"/Numbers.12.5\">5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 12:10\" href=\"/Numbers.12.10\">10</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 12:15\" href=\"/Numbers.12.15\">15</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 20:1\" href=\"/Numbers.20.1\">20:1</a> (all JE), <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 24:9\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.24.9\">Dt 24:9</a> <a data-ref=\"Micah 6:4\" href=\"/Micah.6.4\">Mi 6:4</a>. 𝔊 Μαριαμ.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <strong> m.</strong> (prob.) a Judahite <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 4:17\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.4.17\">1 Ch 4:17</a>. 𝔊 τὸν Μαιων, 𝔊L Μωεωρ.","next":"BDB, מְרִירוּת","prev":"BDB, מְרָיוֹת"}